        assignment: { heading: "Assignment — Examine the cost of your choices", text: `Read Genesis 25:19–34 and Genesis 27:1–45. Write about one situation in which you pursued something you wanted without adequately considering the consequences for others. Identify one way you could act more honestly and fairly in a similar situation. Share your reflection with a trusted peer.` },
