        assignment: { heading: "Assignment — Practise honesty in an agreement", text: `Read Genesis 29–31. Review one agreement or responsibility in your own life—at work, at home, in a church team or in a shared project. Ask whether expectations are clear and whether everyone is being treated fairly. If appropriate, clarify an unclear commitment or address an imbalance respectfully.` },
